D) 0500-1600
E) SMALL TACTICAL UAS WILL BE PERFORMING BEYOND VISUAL LINE OF SIGHT
FLIGHTS FOR MARITIME SURVEILLANCE IN AREA:
345743N 0321725E - 345957N 0321936E - 345819N 0322328E - 
345619N 0322258E - 345743N 0321725E/AREA 9
THE AREA WILL BE ACTIVATED IN REAL TIME THROUGH FULL TACTICAL
COORDINATION BETWEEN UAS OPERATOR AND PAFOS ATC. 
