A4135/26 NOTAMN
Q) LTAA/QWMLW/IV/BO /W /240/310/3759N04303E078
A) LTAA B) 2609302100 C) 2612312059
E) EXERCISE WILL TAKE PLACE (WITHOUT FIRING) (H24)
AIR TRAFFIC FLOW REGULATION NOTAM WILL BE ISSUED
AREA: 373700N0443600E 375000N0413000E 382000N0413000E 
382034N0432322E 
375755N0441520E 375312N0441322E 375121N0441754E 375038N0442316E 
374513N0442817E 374603N0443342E 374218N0443637E 373923N0443329E 
373700N0443600E
RMK: IFR TRAFFICS DEPARTING OR LANDING FROM LTCV ,LTCL, LTCW , LTCI 
AIRPORTS AND IFR TRAFFICS LANDING THROUGH TO OR DEPARTING FROM 
BAGHDAD FIR ARE EXCLUDED. THESE TRAFFIC'S AREA USAGE REQUESTS SHALL 
BE DECIDED UPON THE COORDINATION BETWEEN ANKARA ACC AND BIKIM.
THE PILOTS OF AIRCRAFT THAT ARE MAKING AVOIDANCE MANEUVERS OUTSIDE
THE AIRWAY OR UNABLE COMPLY WITH THE FLIGHT LEVELS, SHALL INFORM ATC
UNIT IMMEDIATELY. 
IN SUCH A CASE, FLIGHT WILL BE CONTINUED SAFELY WITHIN EXERCISE AREA
BY MEANS OF CIVIL/MILITARY COORDINATION
TRAFFIC FLYING ON AWYS G/UG8, T/UT888 AND T/UT36 SHALL MAKE
