VERTICAL LIMITS: SFC-20000FT AMSL
NOTE1: WHEN AIR DEFENCE SYSTEMS ARE IN NORMAL STATUS, ALL MIL/CIV 
TFCS WILL NOT BE AFFECTED.
NOTE2: WHEN AIR DEFENCE SYSTEMS BECOME ACTIVE, ALL TFCS WI(10NM) OF 
KONYA AD WILL BE DIRECTED TO LAND BY THE KONYA APCH, AND TFCS 
OUTSIDE(10NM) WILL BE HELD AT POINTS NORTH OF THE AREA AS DEEMED 
APPROPRIATE BY KONYA APCH.
NECESSARY COORDINATIONS WILL BE ESTABLISHED TO ENSURE THAT FLIGHTS 
FROM KTO KARATAY UNIVERSITY AIR PARK DO NOT AFFECT THE AREA.
